        "observations": [
          "The steep liquid branch, horizontal A-B plateau and declining vapor branch are visible with p/V arrows, origin 0 and V1/V2 labels.",
          "All four horizontal cylinder bodies, four pistons and four rods are visible. Dashed state constructions align each piston front with its graph state.",
          "The four states run from gas to condensation onset at B/V2, intermediate liquid-vapor mixture and all-liquid completion at A/V1.",
          "The third state retains a shallow lower liquid layer beneath vapor dots; the fourth retains all-liquid material. Dots and hatching remain uncalibrated material marks, not measured amounts.",
          "The V label was moved downward to clear the padded axis-arrow endpoint. No other text, source/context, apparatus geometry or assertion changed."
